<p>Channel hot steam around your saws, burning foes you strike in melee for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">71, 96, 115, 131, 145</acronym> fire damage over 3 turns (which can stack)!</p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">Hot, steamy maiming!</span></span></p>